{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14221080","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14221080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1422108001:0":{"text":"최근 근무 중에, 왕성에서 평민 지역으로 들어간 사람 없었나?","source_cn":"你最近执勤的时候时有没有放行从王城来到平民区的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C80CC2FBC0EB08E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422108002:0":{"text":"네! 왕성에서 추방당한 하인 외에는 수상한 자는 없었습니다! 아니... 네... 그, 귀족 한 명이 있었습니다만...","source_cn":"报告大人！除了那些被驱赶出王城的仆从外，绝对没有放行任...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7672B352F88D312","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422108003:0":{"text":"귀족 옷차림을 하고 자기가 자작이라고 하더군요. 집에서 도망친 하인을 쫓는다는 말에 막을 수가 없었습니다. 죄송합니다!","source_cn":"那个人穿着贵族服饰，说他是一位子爵，正在追赶家里的逃奴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BAE44B29ECC8A7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422108004:0":{"text":"...그래, 계속 근무하도록.","source_cn":"……知道了，继续执勤吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x012E3FC01E9EB82A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:大意的卫兵":{"text":"방심한 경비병","source":"大意的卫兵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}